hadiths[69]{hadithnumber,text}:
"579","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umrah se umrah tak darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hai, aur hajj mabroor ka badla siwae jannat ke kuch nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"580","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya aurton par jihad hai? Aap ne farmaya: Han, un par jihad hai jis mein qital nahin hai: Hajj aur Umrah. Ise Ahmad aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Ibn Majah ke hain, aur is ki sanad sahih hai; aur is ki asl Sahih mein hai."
"581","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek dehati aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe Umrah ke bare mein batayen, kya woh wajib hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, aur tum umrah karo yeh tumhare liye behtar hai. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur rajeh is ka mauqoof hona hai; aur Ibn Adi ne ise doosri za'if wajh se Jabir se marfoo'an nikala: Hajj aur Umrah do fareeze hain."
"582","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Rasta kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Zadraah aur sawari. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha, magar rajeh is ka mursal hona hai; aur Tirmidhi ne ise Ibn Umar ki hadees se bhi nikala, aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"583","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Rawha mein ek sawar giroh se mile to farmaya: Qaum kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Musalman. Phir unhon ne kaha: Aap kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam). To ek aurat ne Aap ki taraf ek bachcha uthaya aur kaha: Kya is ka hajj hai? Aap ne farmaya: Han, aur tumhen ajr hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"584","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Fazl bin Abbas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche sawar the; to Khas'am ki ek aurat aai, to Fazl use dekhne lage aur woh unhen dekhne lagi, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fazl ka chehra doosri taraf pherne lage. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ka fareeza bandon par hajj mein mere walid ko buddha pa chuka hai jo sawari par jam nahin sakte, kya main un ki taraf se hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Han. Aur yeh Hajjat al-Wada mein tha. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"585","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Juhainah ki ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Meri walidah ne hajj ki nazr mani thi magar woh hajj na kar sakin yahan tak ke inteqal kar gayin, kya main un ki taraf se hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Han, un ki taraf se hajj karo; batayo agar tumhari walidah par qarz hota to kya tum use ada kartin? Allah ka qarz ada karo, kyunke Allah wafadar hone ka ziyada haqdar hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"586","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi bachcha hajj kare phir baligh ho jae to us par doosra hajj hai; aur jo bhi ghulam hajj kare phir aazad ho jae to us par doosra hajj hai. Ise Ibn Abi Shaibah aur Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya aur is ke rijaal siqah hain, magar is ke marfoo' hone mein ikhtilaf hua, aur mahfooz hai ke yeh mauqoof hai."
"587","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna farmate: Koi aadmi kisi aurat se tanhai na kare siwae is ke ke us ke sath mahram ho, aur aurat safar na kare siwae mahram ke sath. To ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri biwi hajj ke liye nikli hai jabke mera naam falan falan ghazwe mein likha gaya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur apni biwi ke sath hajj karo. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"588","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko kehte suna: Labbaik Shubrumah ki taraf se. Aap ne farmaya: Shubrumah kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Mera bhai ya mera qareebi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apni taraf se hajj kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Apni taraf se hajj karo, phir Shubrumah ki taraf se hajj karo. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ahmad ke nazdeek rajeh is ka mauqoof hona hai."
"589","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tum par hajj likh diya hai. To Aqra' bin Habis khade hue aur kaha: Kya har saal Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Agar main kehta to wajib ho jata; hajj ek martaba hai, phir jo ziyada ho woh nafl hai. Ise Khamsa ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Muslim mein Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se hai."
"590","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Madinah ke liye Zul-Hulaifah, Ahle Sham ke liye Juhfah, Ahle Najd ke liye Qarn al-Manazil aur Ahle Yaman ke liye Yalamlam miqat muqarrar farmaya; yeh un ke liye aur jo un par se guzre un ke siwa mein se jo hajj ya umrah ka irada kare us ke liye hain; aur jo is se andar ho to jahan se woh nikle wahan se, yahan tak ke Ahle Makkah Makkah se. Muttafaq alaih."
"591","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Iraq ke liye Zat Irq miqat muqarrar farmaya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Muslim mein Jabir ki hadees se hai magar is ke rawi ko is ke marfoo' hone mein shak hua; aur Bukhari mein hai ke Umar ne Zat Irq miqat muqarrar kiya; aur Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ke han Ibn Abbas se hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Mashriq ke liye Aqiq miqat muqarrar farmaya."
"592","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hajjat al-Wada ke saal nikle; to ham mein se kisi ne umrah ka ehram bandha, kisi ne hajj aur umrah ka, aur kisi ne hajj ka; aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hajj ka ehram bandha. To jo umrah ka ehram bandhe the woh halal ho gae; aur jo hajj ka ya hajj aur umrah dono ka ehram bandhe the woh halal na hue yahan tak ke Qurbani ka din aa gaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"593","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne siwae masjid ke paas se ehram na bandha. Muttafaq alaih."
"594","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khallad bin Sa'ib apne walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibrail aae aur mujhe hukm diya ke apne sahaba ko hukm dun ke ehram ki awazen buland karen. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"595","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ehram ke liye nange hue aur ghusl farmaya. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise hasan kaha."
"596","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya ke muhrim kaun se kapde pahne? To Aap ne farmaya: Qameezen na pahno, amame na pahno, shalwaren na pahno, topiyan na pahno, mouze na pahno; siwae us ke jo jootiyan na pae to mouze pahne aur unhen takhnon se neeche kaat le; aur kapdon mein se koi cheez na pahno jise za'fran ya wars laga ho. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"597","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke ehram ke liye ehram se pahle khushbu lagati, aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye Baitullah ke tawaf se pahle. Muttafaq alaih."
"598","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Muhrim nikah na kare, nikah na karae aur na paigham bheje. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"599","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se un ke جنگli gadhe ke shikar ke qisse mein jabke woh ghair muhrim the riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba se farmaya jabke woh muhrim the: Kya tum mein se kisi ne use hukm diya ya us ki taraf kisi cheez se ishara kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To us ke gosht mein se jo bacha hai khao. Muttafaq alaih."
"600","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'b bin Jassamah Laisi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko جنگli gadha hadiya kiya jabke Aap Abwa ya Waddan mein the, to Aap ne use wapas kar diya aur farmaya: Ham ne use tumhen siwae is liye wapas nahin kiya ke ham muhrim hain. Muttafaq alaih."
"601","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se paanch sab fasiq hain jo hal aur haram mein qatl kiye jaenge: kawwa, cheel, bichchu, chuha aur katne wala kutta. Muttafaq alaih."
"602","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae jabke Aap muhrim the. Muttafaq alaih."
"603","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Ujrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya jabke juen mere chehre par gir rahi thin, to Aap ne farmaya: Main nahin samajhta tha ke takleef tumhen itni pahunchi hai jitni main dekhta hun; kya tum bakri pate ho? Main ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To teen din roze rakho ya chhe miskeenon ko khana khilao, har miskeen ke liye aadha sa'. Muttafaq alaih."
"604","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab Allah ne Apne Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par Makkah fath kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein khade hue aur Allah ki hamd aur sana ki, phir farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Makkah se hathi ko rok diya aur us par Apne Rasool aur mu'minon ko ghalib kiya; aur beshak woh mujh se pahle kisi ke liye halal na hui, aur mere liye din ki ek ghadi halal ki gayi; aur beshak woh mere baad kisi ke liye halal na hogi; to us ka shikar na bhagaya jae, us ke kante na kate jaen, us ki giri hui cheez siwae elan karne wale ke liye halal nahin hai; aur jis ka koi maqtool qatl kiya jae woh do behtar rayon mein hai. To Abbas ne kaha: Siwae izkhir ke Ya Rasulullah? Kyunke ham use apni qabron aur gharon mein rakhte hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Siwae izkhir ke. Muttafaq alaih."
"605","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid bin Asim (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram banaya aur us ke walon ke liye dua ki; aur beshak main ne Madinah ko haram banaya jaise Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram banaya; aur beshak main ne us ke sa' aur mudd mein us se dogni dua ki jo Ibrahim ne Ahle Makkah ke liye ki thi. Muttafaq alaih."
"606","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Madinah Ayr se Saur tak haram hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"607","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hajj kiya to ham Aap ke sath nikle yahan tak ke Zul-Hulaifah pahunche; to Asma bint Umais ke han bacha paida hua, to Aap ne farmaya: Ghusl karo, kapde se langot bandho aur ehram bandho. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masjid mein namaz padhi, phir Qaswa par sawar hue yahan tak ke jab Baida par seedhi huin to tauheed se ehram bandha: Labbaik Allahumma labbaik, labbaik la shareeka laka labbaik, innal hamda wan-ni'mata laka wal-mulk, la shareeka lak. Yahan tak ke jab ham Baitullah pahunche to rukn ko chhua, teen mein ramal kiya aur chaar mein paidal chale, phir Maqam Ibrahim par aae aur namaz padhi, phir rukn ki taraf wapas aae aur use chhua. Phir darwaze se Safa ki taraf nikle; phir jab Safa se qareeb hue to padha: Beshak Safa aur Marwah Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain [Surah Baqarah: 158]; main us se shuru karta hun jis se Allah ne shuru kiya. Phir Safa par chadhe yahan tak ke Baitullah dekha, qibla ki taraf munh kiya aur Allah ki wahdaniyat aur takbir bayan ki aur farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, Usi ki badshahat hai, Usi ki hamd hai, aur Woh har cheez par qadir hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Us ne apna wa'da poora kiya, Apne bande ki madad ki aur akele grohon ko shikast di. Phir is ke darmiyan teen martaba dua ki, phir Marwah ki taraf utre yahan tak ke dono qadam wadi ke pet mein beh gae [daud lagayi] yahan tak ke jab chadhe to Marwah tak paidal chale aur Marwah par waisa kiya jaisa Safa par kiya tha... Phir hadees zikr ki. Aur is mein hai ke jab Tarwiyah ka din aaya to Mina ki taraf mutawajjah hue, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sawar hue aur wahan Zuhr, Asr, Maghrib, Isha aur Fajr padhin, phir thodi der thehre yahan tak ke suraj nikla, phir chale yahan tak ke Arafah pahunche aur Namirah mein Aap ke liye khema laga paya to wahan utre. Yahan tak ke jab suraj dhal gaya to Qaswa ka hukm diya jo Aap ke liye tayyar ki gayi, phir wadi ke pet mein aae aur logon ko khutba diya. Phir azan di phir iqamat kahi aur Zuhr padhai, phir iqamat kahi aur Asr padhai, aur un donon ke darmiyan kuch na padha. Phir sawar hue yahan tak ke mauqif par aae aur apni untni Qaswa ka pet patharon ki taraf kiya aur paidal chalne walon ki rassi apne samne rakhi aur qibla ki taraf munh kiya; aur musalsal thehre rahe yahan tak ke suraj doob gaya aur zardi thodi chali gayi yahan tak ke tikiya chhup gayi; aur chale jabke Qaswa ki lagam kheechi hui thi yahan tak ke us ka sar Aap ke kajave ke agle hisse ko lagta tha, aur apne dayan hath se farmate: Aey logo! Sukoon! Sukoon! Jab bhi kisi teele par aate us ke liye thoda dheela karte yahan tak ke chadh jati. Yahan tak ke Muzdalifah pahunche aur wahan Maghrib aur Isha ek azan aur do iqamaton se padhin, aur un donon ke darmiyan koi nafl na padha; phir lete rahe yahan tak ke Fajr tulu' hui aur Fajr padhi jab subah zahir ho gayi ek azan aur iqamat se. Phir sawar hue yahan tak ke Mash'ar Haram par aae aur qibla ki taraf munh kiya aur use pukara, takbir aur tahlil kahi; aur musalsal thehre rahe yahan tak ke khoob roshan ho gaya. Phir suraj nikalne se pahle chale yahan tak ke Batn Muhassir pahunche aur thoda tez chale, phir darmiyana rasta liya jo bade jamre par nikalta hai yahan tak ke us jamre par aae jo darakht ke paas hai, to use saat kankariyan marin har kankari ke sath takbir kehte hue, chane ke dane jaisi, wadi ke pet se mari; phir qurban-gah ki taraf wapas hue aur qurbani ki; phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sawar hue aur Baitullah ki taraf tawaf ifaza ke liye gae aur Makkah mein Zuhr padhi. Ise Muslim ne taweel riwayat kiya."
"608","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khuzaimah bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab hajj ya umrah mein apni talbiyah se farigh hote to Allah se Us ki khushnudi aur jannat mangte aur Us ki rahmat se aag se panah mangte. Ise Shafi'i ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"609","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne yahan qurbani ki hai aur Mina sara qurban-gah hai to apne thikanon mein qurbani karo; aur main ne yahan wuqoof kiya hai aur Arafah sara mauqif hai; aur main ne yahan wuqoof kiya hai aur Muzdalifah sara mauqif hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"610","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Makkah aae to us mein upar se dakhil hue aur neeche se nikle. Muttafaq alaih."
"611","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Makkah na aate siwae is ke ke Zu Tuwa mein raat guzarte yahan tak ke subah hoti aur ghusl farmate; aur is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke han karte. Muttafaq alaih."
"612","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh Hajar Aswad ka bosa lete aur us par sajda karte. Ise Hakim ne marfoo'an riwayat kiya, aur Baihaqi ne mauqoofan."
"613","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke teen pheron mein ramal karen aur chaar mein paidal chalen jo dono ruknon ke darmiyan hain. Muttafaq alaih."
"614","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab woh Baitullah ka pehla tawaf farmate to teen mein daudte aur chaar mein paidal chalte; aur ek riwayat mein hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab hajj ya umrah mein pahli martaba tawaf farmate to Baitullah ke teen pheron mein daudte aur chaar mein paidal chalte. Muttafaq alaih."
"615","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Baitullah mein se Yamani do ruknon ke siwa chhute nahin dekha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"616","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Hajar Aswad ka bosa liya aur kaha: Beshak main janta hun ke tum pathar ho na nuqsan dete ho na nafa; aur agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko tumhara bosa lete na dekha hota to main tumhara bosa na leta. Muttafaq alaih."
"617","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Tufail (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Baitullah ka tawaf karte dekha jabke Aap apne paas maujood chhadi se rukn ko chhute aur chhadi ka bosa lete. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"618","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sabz chadar mein iztiba karke tawaf kiya. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"619","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham mein se ehram bandhne wala ehram bandhta to us par inkar na kiya jata, aur ham mein se takbir kehne wala takbir kehta to us par inkar na kiya jata. Muttafaq alaih."
"620","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bhari saman ya kamzoron mein Muzdalifah se raat mein bheja. Muttafaq alaih."
"621","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Saudah ne Muzdalifah ki raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi ke Aap se pahle chalen jabke woh sust thin [yani bhari thin] to Aap ne unhen ijazat di. Muttafaq alaih."
"622","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jamre ko suraj nikalne se pahle na maro. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur is mein inqita hai."
"623","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umm Salamah ko Qurbani ki raat bheja to unhon ne Fajr se pahle jamra mara, phir chalin aur tawaf ifaza kiya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad Muslim ki shart par hai."
"624","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah bin Mudarris (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamari is namaz mein hazir ho [yani Muzdalifah mein] aur hamare sath thehra raha yahan tak ke ham chalen, jabke us ne us se pahle Arafah mein raat ya din mein wuqoof kiya ho to us ka hajj poora ho gaya aur us ne apna mail khatm kiya. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"625","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mushrik ifaza na karte yahan tak ke suraj nikal aata, aur kehte: Sabir chamko. Aur beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki mukhalifat ki, phir suraj nikalne se pahle ifaza kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"626","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas aur Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) musalsal talbiyah kehte rahe yahan tak ke Jamrat al-Aqabah ko mara. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"627","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Baitullah ko apne baen aur Mina ko apne dayen kiya aur jamre ko saat kankariyan marin aur kaha: Yeh us ka maqam hai jis par Surah Baqarah nazil hui. Muttafaq alaih."
"628","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Qurbani ke din jamra chaasht mein mara, aur us ke baad jab suraj dhal jata. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"629","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh chhote jamre ko saat kankariyan marte, har kankari ke baad takbir kehte, phir aage badhte aur naram zameen par aate aur khade hote aur qibla ki taraf munh karte aur lambi der khade rehte aur dua mangte aur dono hath uthate, phir darmiyana jamra marte, phir baen lete aur naram zameen par aate aur qibla ki taraf munh karke khade hote, phir dua mangte aur dono hath uthate aur lambi der khade rehte, phir Aqabah wale jamre ko wadi ke pet se marte aur us ke paas na thehrte, phir wapas hote aur farmate: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aisa karte dekha hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"630","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah sar mundwane walon par raham farma. Unhon ne kaha: Aur katwane walon par Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne teesri martaba farmaya: Aur katwane walon par. Muttafaq alaih."
"631","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hajjat al-Wada mein thehre to woh Aap se poochhne lage; to ek aadmi ne kaha: Mujhe khabar na hui aur main ne zabah se pahle sar mundwa liya. Aap ne farmaya: Zabah karo aur harj nahin hai. Phir doosra aaya aur kaha: Mujhe khabar na hui aur main ne rami se pahle qurbani kar di. Aap ne farmaya: Rami karo aur harj nahin hai. To us din Aap se kisi cheez ke bare mein jo aage ya peeche ki gayi thi na poocha gaya magar Aap ne farmaya: Karo aur harj nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"632","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miswar bin Makhramah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar mundwane se pahle qurbani ki aur apne sahaba ko is ka hukm diya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"633","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum rami karo aur sar mundwao to tumhare liye khushbu aur har cheez halal ho gayi siwae aurton ke. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"634","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aurton par sar mundwana nahin hai, woh sirf katwengi. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"635","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi ke apni saqayat ki wajah se Mina ki raaton mein Makkah mein raat guzaren, to Aap ne unhen ijazat di. Muttafaq alaih."
"636","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asim bin Adi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unt charane walon ko Mina mein raat guzarne se ruksat di ke Qurbani ke din rami karen, phir agle din do dinon ki rami karen, phir kooch ke din rami karen. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"637","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Qurbani ke din khutba diya... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"638","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sarra bint Nabhan (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sar ke din khutba diya aur farmaya: Kya yeh Tashreeq ke darmiyani din nahin hai? Al-hadees. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"639","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tumhara Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa Marwah ke darmiyan tumhare hajj aur umrah ke liye kafi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"640","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us saat mein ramal na kiya jis mein tawaf ifaza kiya tha. Ise Khamsa ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"641","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zuhr, Asr, Maghrib aur Isha padhin, phir Muhassab mein thodi der soe, phir Baitullah ki taraf sawar hue aur us ka tawaf kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"642","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh aisa na karti thin [yani Abtah mein utarna] aur farmati thin: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is mein siwae is liye utre kyunke woh Aap ke nikalne ke liye kushada manzil tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"643","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke logon ko hukm diya gaya ke un ka aakhri ahd Baitullah se ho, magar haiza se takhfeef ki gayi. Muttafaq alaih."
"644","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz us ke siwa hazaar namazon se afzal hai siwae Masjid Haram ke; aur Masjid Haram mein namaz meri masjid mein namaz se sau namazon se afzal hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"645","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko rok diya gaya to Aap ne sar mundwaya aur apni biwiyon se mile aur apni hadi zabah ki yahan tak ke agle saal umrah kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"646","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zubair bin Abdul Muttalib ki beti Dubaa'ah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aae to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main hajj ka irada rakhti hun jabke main beemar hun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajj karo aur shart lagao ke mera halal hona wahan hai jahan Tu mujhe rok de. Muttafaq alaih."
"647","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ikrimah se Hajjaj bin Amr Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo toot jae ya langda ho jae woh halal ho gaya hai, aur us par agle saal hajj hai. Ikrimah ne kaha: To main ne Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurairah se is ke bare mein poocha? To un donon ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
